# Project Workflow Rules

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the primary execution contract for all tasks.

Required workflow docs:
- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/agents/00_INTAKE.md`
- `docs/agents/01_PLAN.md`
- `docs/agents/02_EXECUTION_LOG.md`
- `docs/agents/03_VALIDATION.md`
- `docs/agents/04_HANDOFF.md`
- `docs/agents/DECISIONS.md`
- `docs/agents/BLOCKERS.md`

UI work rule:
- For any UI/layout/style/interaction/copy hierarchy task, follow `docs/agents/UI_MASTERPLAN.md`.
- If a requested UI change conflicts with `docs/agents/UI_MASTERPLAN.md`, log the exception in `docs/agents/DECISIONS.md` before implementation.

Execution constraints:
- Keep scope narrow to the user request.
- Keep one active task step in progress.
- Do not claim completion without validation evidence.
